@startuml Mark Read News by Student
actor Student
participant ": SystemAnnouncementsPage " as SystemAnnouncementsPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": SystemAnnouncementController " as SystemAnnouncementController
participant ": SystemAnnouncementService " as SystemAnnouncementService
database Database

Student->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 1. Click on an announcement or view announcement detail
    activate Student
    activate SystemAnnouncementsPage

SystemAnnouncementsPage->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 2. Get current userId

SystemAnnouncementsPage->Router: 3. Send POST /api/systemannouncement/{id}/mark-viewed
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementsPage
    activate Router

Router->SystemAnnouncementController: 4. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate SystemAnnouncementController

SystemAnnouncementController->SystemAnnouncementController: 5. GetCurrentUserId() from JWT token

SystemAnnouncementController->SystemAnnouncementService: 6. MarkAsViewedAsync(announcementId, userId)
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementController
    activate SystemAnnouncementService

SystemAnnouncementService->SystemAnnouncementService: 7. Mark announcement as viewed (TODO: implement tracking)

SystemAnnouncementService-->SystemAnnouncementController: 8. Return true
    activate SystemAnnouncementController
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementService

SystemAnnouncementController-->Router: 9. Send Success Response (200)
    activate Router
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementController

Router-->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 10. Mark as Viewed Successfully
    activate SystemAnnouncementsPage
    deactivate Router

SystemAnnouncementsPage->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 11. Save to localStorage (viewedAnnouncements[userId][announcementId] = true)

SystemAnnouncementsPage->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 12. Update UI (mark announcement as viewed)

SystemAnnouncementsPage->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 13. Update viewedAnnouncements state

SystemAnnouncementsPage-->Student: 14. Show announcement as viewed
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementsPage
    deactivate Student
@enduml




